<?php $pages=max(1,(int)ceil(($total??0)/($per??10))); $page=(int)($page??1); if($pages>1): ?><nav><ul class="pagination"><li class="page-item <?=$page<=1?'disabled':''?>"><a class="page-link" href="?<?=http_build_query(array_merge($_GET,['page'=>max(1,$page-1)]))?>">Previous</a></li><?php for($i=1;$i<=$pages;$i++): ?><li class="page-item <?=$i===$page?'active':''?>"><a class="page-link" href="?<?=http_build_query(array_merge($_GET,['page'=>$i]))?>"><?=$i?></a></li><?php endfor; ?><li class="page-item <?=$page>=$pages?'disabled':''?>"><a class="page-link" href="?<?=http_build_query(array_merge($_GET,['page'=>min($pages,$page+1)]))?>">Next</a></li></ul></nav><?php endif;?>